{"id": "85905", "name": "משוואת ישר – דרך נקודה עם שיפוע נתון (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find the equation of a straight line in the \\((x,y)\\) plane which passes through \\(({{CT:0}},{{CT:1}})\\) and has gradient \\({{CT:2}}\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Use the point-slope form of a straight line, then expand and collect the constant terms.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The point-slope form</b><br>Recall that the equation of a straight line passing through the point \\((x_1,y_1)\\) with gradient \\(m\\) is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y-y_1=m(x-x_1). \\]</p>So substituting in the values we get:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y-{{CT:1}}={{CT:2}}(x-{{CT:0}}), \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Rearranging</b><br>Which gives the equation of the line:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} y - {{CT:1}} &= {{CT:2}}(x-{{CT:0}}),\\\\ y - {{CT:1}} &= {{CT:2}}x - {{CT:3}},\\\\ y &= {{CT:4}}. \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "y=m*x+d", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "GEO-EQL-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "GEO-EQL-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "y=m*x+e", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "WRONG_FORMULA", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">It seems you have forgotten to multiply the gradient, \\(m\\) and \\(x_1\\).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "GEO-EQL-1-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["c", "d", "e", "m", "x1", "y1"], "nvariants": 50}